# AI-Assisted Recruitment Automation

**Final Capstone Project — Week 6, AI Automation Internship**
**Petalnex Pvt. Ltd.** | Intern: Sajeel Ali

An end-to-end n8n workflow that screens job applications, scores candidate fit using Google Gemini, cross-checks that score against deterministic rules, and routes every final decision through mandatory human review before a candidate is notified or the database is updated.

